              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "réservé — \"reserved, quiet (of a person); booked\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mon frère est un garçon réservé; il parle peu de lui. My brother is a reserved boy; he says little about himself."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Of a table or a seat it means booked: une table réservée."
            }
          ]
        },
